@startuml "Renouvellement de token - Diagramme de séquence"

title Processus de renouvellement de token JWT

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Controller" as AuthCtrl
participant "Auth Service" as AuthSvc
participant "User Service" as UserSvc
participant "Redis Cache" as Redis
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Renouvellement de token ==
Frontend -> Frontend: Token expire dans 1h
activate Frontend
Frontend -> API: POST /api/auth/refresh
note right: Body: {refreshToken}
activate API

API -> AuthCtrl: refreshToken(refreshToken)
activate AuthCtrl

AuthCtrl -> Redis: GET refresh:{token}
activate Redis
Redis --> AuthCtrl: userId
deactivate Redis

alt Refresh token valide
    AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: getUserById(userId)
    activate UserSvc
    UserSvc -> DB: SELECT user WHERE id=?
    activate DB
    DB --> UserSvc: user data
    deactivate DB
    deactivate UserSvc
    
    AuthCtrl -> AuthSvc: generateJWT(user)
    activate AuthSvc
    AuthSvc -> AuthSvc: jwt.sign({userId, role}, secret, {expiresIn: '7d'})
    AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl: new JWT token
    deactivate AuthSvc
    
    AuthCtrl -> AuthSvc: generateRefreshToken(userId)
    activate AuthSvc
    AuthSvc -> Redis: SET refresh:{newToken} = userId
    activate Redis
    AuthSvc -> Redis: DEL refresh:{oldToken}
    Redis --> AuthSvc: tokens updated
    deactivate Redis
    deactivate AuthSvc
    
    AuthCtrl --> API: {token, refreshToken}
    deactivate AuthCtrl
    API --> Frontend: new tokens
    deactivate API
    Frontend -> Frontend: Mettre à jour tokens en mémoire
    Frontend --> User: Continuation transparente
    deactivate Frontend
    
else Refresh token invalide ou expiré
    AuthCtrl --> API: 401 Unauthorized
    deactivate AuthCtrl
    API --> Frontend: refresh failed
    deactivate API
    Frontend -> Frontend: Supprimer tokens locaux
    Frontend -> Frontend: Rediriger vers login
    Frontend --> User: "Session expirée, veuillez vous reconnecter"
    deactivate Frontend
end

note over User, DB
    Le renouvellement automatique permet une 
    expérience utilisateur fluide sans déconnexions
end note

@enduml